  "ai_overview": {
    "text_blocks": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Prioritize personal safety by staying off the roof and inspecting from the ground."
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Immediate Safety & Assessment"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Check surroundings: Watch out for downed power lines, flooded areas, and broken tree limbs."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Inspect from the ground: Look for missing or lifted shingles, dented gutters, and shingle granules near downspouts."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Check the interior: Look for ceiling water stains, attic moisture, or active leaks. Place buckets and move valuables."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Learn what to look for from the ground and how to handle the first 24 hours:"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Documentation & Protection"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Take photos and videos: Capture clear images of exterior damage, debris, and interior leaks."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Install a temporary tarp: Cover exposed areas using the board-sandwich method (fastening the tarp between 2x4 boards with screws) to stop active water entry."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "See a step-by-step demonstration on how to securely install a temporary roof tarp:"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Professional Inspection & Insurance"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Hire a local roofer: Schedule a professional inspection before calling your insurance company so hidden damage is properly documented."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "File the claim: Submit your contractor's assessment and photos to your insurance provider if legitimate storm damage is confirmed."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Vetted contractors: Verify a contractor's licensing and avoid out-of-town \"storm chasers\" demanding fast contracts."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "If you'd like, let me know:"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "What type of storm hit (hail, heavy wind, or a fallen tree)?"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Are you currently dealing with an active leak inside?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "I can provide more tailored advice for your situation."
      },
